Fix match patterns and morphism-app diagnostics

Make match-pattern classification resolution-aware so a bound morphism
variable head is matched by unification rather than treated as an
undeclared constructor. Report MorphismArgumentNumber for wrong-arity
morphism applications (including Mor-typed consts) instead of
undetermined type or const-called-as-function. Add compile-error
fixtures and an eval test covering const, member-const, and application
morphism heads.
